OVERVIEW & BRAND CONTEXT

Product Name: VRYOH
Tagline: Governed Review Responses & Guest Signal Intelligence for Managers Under Pressure.
Sub-tagline: Speed Your Responses with confidence, Without Missing What Matters.
Target Audience: Hospitality managers (hotel, restaurant) who are overwhelmed by online review management across multiple platforms.
Core Value Proposition: VRYOH is an AI-powered review intelligence system that detects hidden emotional signals in guest reviews, drafts on-brand responses, and delivers structured weekly/monthly intelligence reports — all with a human approval gate before anything is published.

